<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - Aug 18.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - Aug 18.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JOURNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- A political source told the Angolan News Agency that UNITA was concentrating its troops around Ciumba Senga, in the province of Kwanza Sul.</p>
<p>- Roberto de Almeida, president of the National Assembly, leaves today for a five day visit to Benin where he will attend the 20th conference of the Union of African Parliamentarians.</p>
